# Case run artifacts
**/results/*.pt
**/results/*.npy
**/results/*.npz
**/results/*.dat
**/results/*.png
**/results/*.gif
**/results/*.txt

# Nested visualization outputs
**/results/visualizations/*.png
**/results/visualizations/*.txt

# Allow checked-in explanatory docs where they already exist
!**/results/README.md
!**/results/error.md
!**/results/error_table.md
!**/results/convergence_analysis.md

# Keep reference assets versioned
!**/reference_data/*.m
!**/reference_data/*.mat
